      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 82,
      "y": 898,
      "width": 361.76000000000005,
      "height": 21.25,
      "text": "The two rules that are the entire idea",
      "originalText": "The two rules that are the entire idea",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el-64",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 82,
      "y": 934,
      "width": 662.48,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "1.  INSIDE one group, each partition goes to exactly ONE member.\n    So \"kitchen\" never cooks the same order twice. Add a 4th kitchen pod and it sits IDLE -\n    3 partitions is the ceiling. Partition count caps useful parallelism.",
      "originalText": "1.  INSIDE one group, each partition goes to exactly ONE member.\n    So \"kitchen\" never cooks the same order twice. Add a 4th kitchen pod and it sits IDLE -\n    3 partitions is the ceiling. Partition count caps useful parallelism.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el-65",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 82,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 677.0400000000001,
      "height": 32.5,
      "text": "2.  ACROSS groups, nothing is shared. \"kitchen\" and \"analytics\" both read EVERY order,\n    each with its own bookmark. Adding a new team never slows down or steals from an old one.",
      "originalText": "2.  ACROSS groups, nothing is shared. \"kitchen\" and \"analytics\" both read EVERY order,\n    each with its own bookmark. Adding a new team never slows down or steals from an old one.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el-66",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 851.7600000000001,
      "height": 16.25,
      "text": "A broker is NOT a topic. Broker = the building. Topic = a named shelf inside it. Partition = one stack on that shelf.",
      "originalText": "A broker is NOT a topic. Broker = the building. Topic = a named shelf inside it. Partition = one stack on that shelf.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
